    completionSubtitle: "Afet \xE7antas\u0131 s\u0131rtta. Deniz'in iki eli de Can'a
      yard\u0131m etmek i\xE7in serbest."
    delayAfter: 2.8
  - interactable: {fileID: 1353959431}
    objectiveTitle: "HAZIRLI\u011EIN SONUCUNU G\xD6R"
    objectiveDetail: "Dolaptan kap\u0131ya uzanan g\xFCvenli hatt\u0131 sahnede takip
